s]] called in by [[DeFoe]] to stop [[Dante Vale]], [[Lok Lambert]], and [[Sophie Casterwill]] in the [[Venice Huntik Library]]. This Suit, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and [[Santiago]]. {{Source|The Casterwill Client}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]] and [[spells]].\n\n{{col-begin}}{{col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n\n{{col-2}}\n===Titans Bonded ===\n* [[Redcap]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_id":"huntik:page:8056","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Venice%2C_Italy","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Venice%2C%20Italy"},{"target_title":"Prague, Czech Republic","label":"Prague, Czech Republic","target_id":"huntik:page:8072","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Prague%2C_Czech_Republic","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Prague%2C%20Czech%20Republic"},{"target_title":"The Casterwill Client","label":"The Casterwill Client","target_id":"huntik:page:2512","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Casterwill_Client","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2512"},{"target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url